                        "sense_id": "8f1137a6-a903-3ea5-8f04-c11740d93a02",
                        "entry_id": "508406d1-9c7b-340d-b7d9-13b3196af3dc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A quantity that fills a wain; wagonful."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa7a6b3b-343c-45db-a735-c32ff0f8c86f",
                                "sense_id": "8f1137a6-a903-3ea5-8f04-c11740d93a02",
                                "text": "Farmer John and his comfortable wainful, has the best of my Lord Grateswel, in his uncomfortably aristocratic coach,—for “First come first served,” is the Grasmere Sports' motto."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d295af9b-7559-4145-8fb6-7e9af1cb8956",
                                "sense_id": "8f1137a6-a903-3ea5-8f04-c11740d93a02",
                                "text": "It is a pleasant picture to dwell on ; the farm, a small state. in itself, with the mowers and gleaners singing about the last wainful of corn ;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d00f7d2-390a-40ef-b4ae-337109fe6805",
                                "sense_id": "8f1137a6-a903-3ea5-8f04-c11740d93a02",
                                "text": "They were guided \"by a man in a long smock with girdle and scarf of green,\" and drew \"a wainful of children dressed as woodland gods, tossing daisies and field flowers as they went along.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f3f6567-e272-4b56-9b8f-3c80b59b9ebe",
                                "sense_id": "8f1137a6-a903-3ea5-8f04-c11740d93a02",
                                "text": "It's not just the English wine, he's doing hay-wain rides around les vignes where exactly the wainful of hay is supposed to have come from on a farm covered in grapevines I can't tell you– pick-and-press days, bottle-your-own sessions, with labels for the kiddies to colour in, Christmas wine clubs, cheese and wine-tasting nights with a band and dancing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
